            new HeroIdentityDefinition("LanternKnight", "THE GUIDING LAMP", "Company light", "Nearby friends' basic attacks kindle the lamp (one spark per 0.25s). At 8 sparks, up to four friends join a finite-budget lantern advance under its light. Stay within 4 units to gather sparks. Alone, your own attacks light it. Approach: a focused line, a wide fan, or a protective circle that also snuffs one hostile shot.", "Advance|Fan out|Hold ground", Warm),
