            new HeroIdentityDefinition("GlassDice", "THE LOADED HAND", "Collected gold", "Collect 6 gold to play the visible next die face, with a once every 4s. Faces cast darts, a cross, frost, a coin, healing, or a jackpot. The next face follows a visible six-face sequence. In shops, pay 6 gold to reroll the starting face once per wave. Approach changes the geometry of damage faces.", "Straight bet|Split bet|Around the table", Pink),
