            new HeroIdentityDefinition("PennyBroker", "THE FORWARD ORDER", "Reserved delivery", "In a shop, invest 8 + wave gold (maximum 40) to reserve a named relic for the next shop at a quoted price. Choose curio, drink, or food. One order per wave; the delivery remains through rerolls until bought, then clears. If it becomes ineligible, the investment is returned. Every 10 collected gold signs a small receipt strike in battle.", "Curios|Drinks|Food", Warm),
