            new HeroIdentityDefinition("MoonProwler", "THE SHADOW THAT FOLLOWS", "Shadow steps", "Travel 5 units and your shadow slips behind the nearest enemy. Your next basic attack sends it out of that enemy's far side for a delayed 80% W cut; strike from truly behind the enemy (against its facing) and the basic itself also gains +45%. Flank kills pay 1 gold, maximum 6 per wave. Choose a straight rear cut, a side crescent, or a crossing shadow. Your movement income remains.", "Rear cut|Side crescent|Crossing shadow", Blue),
