            new HeroIdentityDefinition("LanternWeaver", "THE LIVING NETWORK", "Knots", "Basic hits pin up to three living targets. Every fourth attack closes the network, sharing damage over its links. Choose a closed triangle, a stitch toward your position, or a broad seam. Knots last 6s and broken targets are removed; no infinite linked-hit chain.", "Closed weave|Pull stitch|Broad seam", Mint),
            new HeroIdentityDefinition("HourglassStag", "THE TIME DEBT", "Stored damage", "Every blow is a loan: 35% of a personal basic that does not finish its target is deferred, up to three times your weapon damage. The debt is collected from that same enemy after 4s, 2.5s, or 5s depending on your approach, with interest: 320%, 260% or 320% of the bank. Choose a focused payment, early settlement, or frost instalments. Bosses keep moving; debt cannot recursively bank itself.", "Full payment|Early settlement|Winter instalments", Blue),
